PART B: NEURA-X COMMERCIAL LICENSE (Paid)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1. ELIGIBILITY
   A Commercial License is required for:
   a) Companies, corporations, and commercial entities of any size
   b) Startups and businesses using Neura-X in revenue-generating products
   c) Any entity using Neura-X for internal business operations
   d) Any entity using Neura-X in client-facing applications
   e) Any entity with annual revenue exceeding $1,000,000 USD, regardless
      of whether the use is directly revenue-generating

2. GRANT OF RIGHTS
   Under a valid Commercial License, you may:
   a) Use Neura-X in production environments
   b) Train and deploy AI models for commercial products and services
   c) Modify the source code for internal use within your organization
   d) Train and sell AI models built with Neura-X
   e) Access priority support as defined by your license tier
   f) Use Neura-X in client-facing and revenue-generating applications

3. RESTRICTIONS
   Under a Commercial License, you may NOT:
   a) Resell, sublicense, or redistribute the Neura-X source code
   b) Remove, alter, or circumvent the Founder's Watermark or Founder's Lock
   c) Claim ownership of Neura-X's intellectual property
   d) Share the source code outside your licensed organization
   e) Reverse-engineer the Founder's Lock or cryptographic seed

4. COMMERCIAL FEES
   Commercial license fees are determined by the Founder on a case-by-case
   basis and may vary by:
   a) Company size and annual revenue
   b) Number of users/seats
   c) Scope of usage
   d) Support level required

   To obtain a Commercial License, contact: founder@neura-x.dev

